<title>USA: Bridgestone to expand tire plant.</title>
<headline>Bridgestone to expand tire plant.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tenn. 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bridgestone Corp unit Bridgestone/Firestone Inc said Friday it will expand production capacity of its radial passenger and light-truck tire plant in Joliette, Quebec.</p>
<p>Total investment is estimated at US$50 million, the company said.</p>
<p>The company said it plans to increase the plant's current daily output of about 14,000 units to 18,000 units by mid-1998. Employment at the Joliette plant, which currently stands at just over 900, is expected to increase by about 70, the company said.</p>
</text>
